<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Radio started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Radio started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Victor Miller has started coverage of American Radio Systems Corp with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Boston-based radio chain closed Monday at 30-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
